{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達已經宣佈，公司聯合創始人、執掌公司33年的唯一一任CEO黃仁勳即時辭職，同時卸任董事會職務。CFO Colette Kress兼任臨時CEO，Synopsys資深人士Harvey Jones出任公司首位董事會主席，正式CEO人選將同時考慮內外部候選人。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586234.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T06:37:10.897853+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T06:29:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T06:30:31.235611+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T06:30:31.235611+00:00","content_hash":"b4546cd57236bdb8d3948270c421f749aa1896a6ce3102790afadc113a6cf2da","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}